@format 1
@id keyframes.next
@title Move to next keyframe
@area Keyframes
@entry input
@summary Dispatch the next-keyframe shortcut, resolve the nearest known keyframe strictly after the cursor, and propagate it to the timeline and preview.
@flow TB
@related keyframes.scan, keyframes.previous

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias key = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LKeyframeOrchestrator

[input] Next-keyframe command <input>
- Dispatch the next-keyframe shortcut when timeline commands and a spool are active @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...)
> find

[find] Find following point <decision>
- Search stored keyframes strictly after the cursor @ key.LKeyframeMoveFind(...)
? "A following keyframe exists" > move
? "No following keyframe is known" > unavailable

[move] Propagate keyframe target <process>
- Update the cursor, views, keyframe scan request, and preview seek @ flow.PFlowKeyframeMove(...)
> result

[result] Next keyframe resolved <output>
= The cursor and preview move to the nearest known following keyframe time.

[unavailable] No next keyframe <output>
= The move is deferred so nearby keyframes can be scanned later.
